sequenceDiagram
  participant IS as InsightService
  participant MP as MetricsPlatform
  participant PM as Product managers
  rect rgb(255,243,224)
    Note over IS: Proposed aggregate read<br/>With existing credential
    alt Read denied or S1 projection invalid
      Note over IS: Proposed stop<br/>Without publication
    else Permitted S1 record
      IS->>MP: Proposed submission to existing daily intake
      alt Accepted
        Note over MP: Existing replacement<br/>Same account and UTC day
        MP-->>IS: Intake result
      else Failed or unconfirmed
        Note over IS: Proposed incomplete state<br/>Bounded reconciliation
      end
    end
  end
  PM->>MP: Existing reporting access
  rect rgb(252,228,236)
    alt Permitted role
      MP-->>PM: Accepted daily counts
    else Role denied
      MP-->>PM: No records disclosed
    end
  end
